19:09.413 --> 19:11.827
Like precious,
precious blood in an animal,
如同珍贵的，
动物的宝贵血液，

19:11.931 --> 19:15.620
customers are what keeps The
Krusty Krab strong and alive.
客户是我们的基石
蟹堡王坚强而有活力。

19:15.724 --> 19:19.034
Squidward, your ceiling
is talking to me!
章鱼哥，你的天花板
正在跟我说话！

19:19.137 --> 19:20.417
Are you going to order something
你要订购一些东西吗

19:20.482 --> 19:22.896
or just make friends
with the paneling?
或者只是交朋友
与镶板？

19:23.000 --> 19:27.000
Uh... I'll have an uh...
呃……我要一个呃……

19:27.103 --> 19:32.241
Uh... uh... uh... ah...
呃……呃……呃……啊……

19:34.448 --> 19:35.448
What's that?
那是什么？

19:35.517 --> 19:37.379
Patrick, go be stupid
somewhere else.
帕特里克，去傻吧
其他地方。

19:37.482 --> 19:42.965
Ah-ah-ah, Squidward,
remember what Mr. Krabs says.
啊啊啊啊章鱼哥
记住蟹老板说的话。

19:43.758 --> 19:46.206
The ceiling is right, Squidward,
天花板是对的，章鱼哥，

19:46.310 --> 19:48.862
you're not a very good employee.
你不是一个很好的员工。

19:48.965 --> 19:50.034
Fine.
美好的。

19:50.137 --> 19:51.827
May I please take your order?
我可以接受您的订单吗？

19:51.931 --> 19:53.655
I'll have, uh...
我会有，呃...

19:53.758 --> 19:56.068
Ah...
啊...

19:56.172 --> 19:59.068
We'll check in
with these two later.
我们将办理入住手续
以后和这两个一起。

19:59.172 --> 20:03.000
Right now, it's important
that we discuss an:
现在，很重要
我们讨论：

20:04.551 --> 20:05.965
Like the lost gold of Atlantis,
就像亚特兰蒂斯失落的黄金一样，

20:06.068 --> 20:09.551
many consider their Krabby Patty
to be a treasure.
许多人认为他们的蟹肉饼
成为一个宝藏。

20:09.655 --> 20:10.551
And as with every treasure,
和每一件宝藏一样，

20:10.655 --> 20:12.965
there's a thief
ready to steal it.
有一个小偷
准备偷走它。

20:13.068 --> 20:15.965
So it's up to you
to be the watchful eyes of...
所以这取决于你
成为...的警惕之眼

20:16.068 --> 20:18.862
What's this?
这是什么？

20:18.965 --> 20:22.586
It's Mr. Krabs'
business rival, Plankton.
这是蟹老板的
商业竞争对手，浮游生物。

20:22.689 --> 20:25.620
Eat my microscopic dust, Krabs!
蟹蟹们，吃掉我的微尘吧！

20:25.724 --> 20:28.448
Your secret formula
is finally mine!
你的秘密配方
终于是我的了！

20:28.551 --> 20:30.413
He's stealing the formula!
他偷了配方！

20:30.517 --> 20:34.034
What are you going to do,
Mr. SquarePants?
你要做什么，
方裤先生？

20:41.310 --> 20:43.413
You'll never catch me, Krabs,
你永远抓不到我，蟹蟹，

20:43.517 --> 20:48.275
not when I shift into
maximum overdrive!
不是当我转入
最大超速！

20:48.379 --> 20:49.379
Hi-ya!
嗨呀！

20:51.482 --> 20:54.172
I knew I should've
gotten the turbo.
我知道我应该
得到了涡轮。

20:57.551 --> 20:58.862
Hear me, Krabs!
听我说，蟹蟹们！

20:58.965 --> 21:01.275
You'll take this
Krabby Patty from me
你会拿着这个
来自我的蟹黄派蒂

21:01.379 --> 21:03.758
when you pry it
from my cold, dead...
当你撬开它时
从我的寒冷中，死了......

21:11.586 --> 21:13.310
And so another emergency
is avoided,
于是又发生了一次紧急情况
被避免，

21:13.413 --> 21:15.413
thanks to Mr. SquarePants.
感谢方裤先生。

21:15.517 --> 21:17.103
Let's check in
on Squidward again.
让我们检查一下
再次关于章鱼哥。

21:17.206 --> 21:18.206
Uh...
呃...

21:18.275 --> 21:21.137
Psst, Squidward.
嘘，章鱼哥。

21:21.241 --> 21:21.931
Huh?
啊？

21:22.034 --> 21:24.000
Just remember:
只要记住：

21:24.344 --> 21:26.793
Patrick, if I could
make a suggestion,
帕特里克，如果我可以的话
提出建议，

21:26.896 --> 21:29.241
why don't you just
order a Krabby Patty?
你为什么不直接
点一份蟹肉饼？

21:29.344 --> 21:32.137
Great idea, Squidward.
好主意，章鱼哥。

21:32.241 --> 21:34.413
One Krabby Patty, please.
请来一份蟹肉饼。

21:34.517 --> 21:37.620
Is that for here or to go?
是来这里还是去？

21:37.724 --> 21:39.034
Uh...
呃...

21:41.310 --> 21:43.758
Hang in there, Squidward,
it's all part of the job.
坚持住，章鱼哥，
这都是工作的一部分。

21:43.862 --> 21:48.137
Now that we've covered
all the basics of your training,
现在我们已经介绍了
您训练的所有基础知识，

21:48.241 --> 21:51.517
it's time for the moment
you've been waiting for.
现在是时候了
你一直在等待。

22:22.448 --> 22:24.724
Preparing the Krabby Patty!
准备蟹肉饼！

22:24.827 --> 22:28.724
At the center of every great
dynasty is the crown jewel,
在每一个伟大的中心
王朝是皇冠上的明珠，

22:28.827 --> 22:30.827
which keeps it alive
and thriving.
这使它保持活力
并蓬勃发展。

22:30.931 --> 22:35.172
For The Krusty Krab,
this is the Krabby Patty.
对于蟹堡王来说，
这是蟹黄饼。

22:36.482 --> 22:39.379
And now you, the humble employee
off the street,
现在你，这个卑微的员工
离开街道，

22:39.482 --> 22:41.620
the all-too-necessary
human resource
太必要的
人力资源

22:41.724 --> 22:42.734
that keeps this business afloat,
使这项业务得以维持，

22:42.758 --> 22:44.724
will learn the sacred
and dark secrets
将学习神圣的
和黑暗的秘密

22:44.827 --> 22:48.103
of how to prepare,
with your very own hands...
如何准备，
用你自己的双手...

22:49.931 --> 22:51.931
The sumptuous, lip-moistening,
华丽、润唇、

22:52.034 --> 22:55.344
spine-tingling, heart-stopping
pleasure center
让人脊背发麻、心跳停止
游乐中心

22:55.448 --> 22:58.241
that is a Krabby Patty.
那是蟹肉饼。

22:58.344 --> 22:59.482
Are you ready?
你准备好了吗？

23:01.206 --> 23:02.586
Are you sure?
你确定吗？

23:03.689 --> 23:05.862
Okay, the secret formula...
好吧，秘密公式...

